{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOW SUPPORTING TWITCH &amp; YOUTUBE!<br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: This is <u><strong>not</strong></u> an online gambling game. You do not use real money to drop your coins in game. Anything sold in the store is purely cosmetic, and can be purchased with both points earned from playing or steam wallet. This game is to host on your live streams, and your viewers !drop in chat for sh!%s and giggles. Does <u><strong>not</strong></u> cost the streamer or viewer anything to play.<br><br>Easy to setup and connect to your live streams. Once connected, you just drop coins in chat for fun with viewers! Players always have 25 coins to drop even if they hit 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself and your viewers in an interactive gaming experience like never before. As the streamer, you become the host of the virtual arcade. Viewers do not need the game, only Streamers. The machine is designed to be a more realistic experience, without the parody nonsense.  <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/rebuild.gif?t=1744517105\" />\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coin Pusher Live is a community building tool that adds a layer of interactivity to your content, making your stream an even more engaging destination for viewers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/extras/rcp_gif2.gif?t=1744517105\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u></u></i></strong><br><br><strong><i><u>Important</u></i></strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a stream chat interactive game. Coin Pusher Live requires a Twitch or YouTube account to play. Viewers play through a streamer's live stream and do not need to download the game to play. The game will become active once you successfully connect your Stream.\u00a0 To play once connected, type !drop in chat to drop coins.  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Setup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/28e3462a9a0c86d88ac9ee5a3857fa54385df20d.jpg"},{"name":"First Dropper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/22999508d0841fc51c73e10828b01cbe0fedb5b3.jpg"},{"name":"The Shopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/810bb1bf68b9b2e838a07a3977321558655c6b62.jpg"},{"name":"Change it Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/035488c27991024c164cf0a3ba8264f8e5da4122.jpg"},{"name":"Earning Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/7c01463c5f6ffb504e9f432f50068ccf9046476a.jpg"},{"name":"Collecting Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/a7e7a4be03c6e80e881381fa083d01fada1917d8.jpg"},{"name":"Printing Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/af2ed7392553454b079f04bee724ed90fd94b081.jpg"},{"name":"Crowded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/371ee9f0d85076c01e25d78eae27b0024dab3f03.jpg"},{"name":"In All Colors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/41b1cfed9863806787886c3eb4d6cb7739528df9.jpg"},{"name":"Q-tastic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731830/c25592a54bb4cd41320b3d1db4cf7ddc0cb71faa.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2731830?t=1744517105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744517105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets